+// [arover] Is a fight running (fighters in the room) or decided (the game's own screen: result, menus)? The game's
+// result word 0x333700 answers it in every mode that fights: 0 while a fight runs, 2 from its KO, its TIME-UP or its
+// RING-OUT on, 8 when it is left through the pause menu, and 0 again when the next one starts (RAM dumps and logs
