+// exit). Next to it, 0x333704 holds the reason (1 KO, 4 ring-out, 16 exit). The fighter list is never cleared: after a
+// fight its two controllers stay, so the menus that follow are told apart by the result word (or, for the menus
+// below, by their state). A health of 0 was the first rule; it ended team battles at the first KO and missed time-ups
