+// a code (11 floats): 1 table, 2 other furniture, 0 other / none
+void arRoomAddFurniture(const float *boxes, size_t count);
+// [arportal] RETIRED 27.10. (arRoomPortalMode() is always false, see ar_room_collision.cpp): the room was cut in two at
